%% Activity Diagram: Study Session Scheduling with Overlap Detection
flowchart TD
    Start([Group Owner Initiates Schedule Session]) --> InputDetails[Input Session Title, Date, Start Time, End Time, Venue/Link]
    InputDetails --> ValidateFormat{Are required fields present and formatted?}
    
    ValidateFormat -- No --> DisplayFormatError[Display Input Validation Error]
    DisplayFormatError --> InputDetails

    ValidateFormat -- Yes --> CheckTimeBoundary{Is End Time > Start Time AND Start Time > Current Time?}
    CheckTimeBoundary -- No --> DisplayTimeError[Display Time Boundary Error Alert]
    DisplayTimeError --> InputDetails

    CheckTimeBoundary -- Yes --> QueryMemberSchedules[Query Existing Scheduled Sessions for Enrolled Group Members]
    QueryMemberSchedules --> ConflictCheck{Do any enrolled members have overlapping sessions?}

    ConflictCheck -- Yes --> WarnOwner[Display Overlapping Member Warning Dialog]
    WarnOwner --> ProceedDecision{Does Owner want to proceed or reschedule?}
    ProceedDecision -- Reschedule --> InputDetails
    ProceedDecision -- Proceed Regardless --> SaveSession[Insert Record into study_sessions]

    ConflictCheck -- No --> SaveSession
    SaveSession --> InitAttendees[Initialize session_attendees for All Enrolled Members with status='tentative']
    InitAttendees --> EmitSuccess[Return 201 Created & Render on Study Calendar]
    EmitSuccess --> EndNode([Session Successfully Scheduled])
